    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──そうですね……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "不安なことがあれば\r\nなんでも言ってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、いえ\r\nぜひ、受けたいです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ただ、少し気になることがあるのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん、なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今までファッションについて\r\n深く考えたことがなかったので",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私でいいのかな……と",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、真乃やめぐると\r\nファッションの話もするだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "流行りとか、そういう話を\r\n軽くすることはありますけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そこまで詳しい話をするわけではないので",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、灯織はどんなファッションが好きなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普段身に着けるものなら\r\n好みが出るんじゃないかと思うんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "これといってこだわりはありませんが……\r\n派手すぎず動きやすいもの……でしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、 \r\nどういうファッションがお好きですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺か？　うーん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あまり意識したことがなかったな）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "清潔感が\r\nあるといいかな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "可愛い感じかな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "シンプルな感じかな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "一番大事なところですよね\r\n第一印象で半分は決まる……とも言いますし",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が仕事をする上で\r\n大事にしていることなんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ブランドから出ている服の傾向から、\r\n人物像を想像してみるのもいいかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それはいい案ですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "では、清潔感のある服装だったら\r\nプロデューサーを思い浮かべたらいいんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、俺か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ、冗談です",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010220,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうなんですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事柄、衣装とかで見慣れている感じだと\r\n安心するんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それは好みとは違うような気がしますが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\n言われてみれば、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "人によってファッションに求めるものって\r\n様々なんですね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "少し……ヒントになったかもしれません",
