    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010250"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "装飾が少ない方が\r\n動きやすいように思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "機能性は大事ですよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あとは誰が着てるかが\r\n大事かもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002018010270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……？\r\nどういうことですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201801/2002018010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織が何を着ていても、大事なアイドルという\r\n事実に変わりはないってことだ",
